If the tool is unavailable, the process can be performed manually. The relevant Cash Transactions Excel attachments must be downloaded from the shared Outlook mailbox and consolidated into one file. Transactions should then be checked and mapped to the correct fund, master fund and team using the current Fondsliste and the internal mapping data. Unknown or unmapped transactions must be reviewed separately and duplicates checked. The final data should be split by the relevant teams, saved to the designated SharePoint location and the responsible teams informed by email. Source emails should be archived after successful processing.
